"{\"title\":\"Mod of Redemption [BETA]\",\"desc\":\"⚠️MULTIPLAYER DOESN'T WORK⚠️\\n\\nDiscord:\\nhttps://discord.gg/VNneR3U\\nOfficial Wiki (NOT Fandom's):\\nhttps://modofredemption.wiki.gg/wiki/Mod_of_Redemption_Wiki\\n\\nThis mod focuses on the discovery and exploration aspect of Terraria more than combat and bosses, it is best played at a chill pace and not intended for a speedy playthrough. So take your time, have fun.\\n\\nThis beta includes (In comparison to 1.3's version of the mod):\\n- Erhan, a new pre-hardmode boss\\n- Reworking of basically every weapon from 1.3's version\\n- Overhaul to the Abandoned Lab from 1.3's version\\n- Many boss reworks or tweaks from 1.3's version\\n- Alignment, a semi-work-in-progress mechanic where actions can alter alignment, so far it only changes if Dragon-Lead or Gathic Cryo-Crystals will gen and if Nebuleus will let you fight a new phase, but more will be planned.\\n- Removal of druid class, as the quality no longer matches the rest of the mod, however be patient for the upcoming Ritualist Class!\\n- Elemental system where weapons and projectiles can have elements set to them that certain enemies can be resistant or weak to\\n- Guard Points, a new value that blocks damage for a certain amount of hits until its broken, enemies with guard points wont take knockback. Hammers and explosives deal increased damage to guard points and Psychic elemental weapons will ignore guard points completely.\\n- Removal of bloat content from 1.3's version\\n- Reworks of various enemy AIs from 1.3's version\\n- Fowl Morning Event (Chicken Invasion Rework)\\n\\nTHE FOLLOWING CONTENT IS **NOT** IN THIS VERSION, BUT IS PLANNED FOR FULL 0.8:\\n- Multiplayer Compatibility (Multiplayer is broken)\\n- Ritualist Class\\n- Soulless Caverns along with it's boss\\n- Deep Space\\n- 4th Omega Prototype\\n- Ruined Kingdom\\n- Post-ML Biome Expansions\\n\\nMod of Redemption is a lore-based mod (very scary) that adds a wide range of content.\\nCurrently, there are:\\n- 1100+ Items\\n- 200+ NPCs/Enemies\\n- 11 Bosses\\n- 11 Minibosses\\n- 500+ Tiles\\n\\nCredit to Thalzon for some of the enemy/boss designs & Pluto for Nebuleus' background\\n\\nThank you to the epic Patreons:\\nLuna!, Lantard, Arche, Rainbr1nger11, catsounds, Nechrom, Sneaklone, HikariAnimator, Noah Felt, Omega D, Albino gonkvader, thunder, Daawnily, Cynx303, Renk, Megaswave, Styxl, Mr. Sarge, Ardlan, Ballistic Banana, Zoey (vocaloid shoegaze album), Joshua DiBella (the fridge man), uncon_arts, Josh Mitchell (Imperator_Zero), Emperor OwO, Waasephi, Smuggy, gtoktas, RansnowATB, DualBlades, Cactusthing (sir_disgruntled), B.L.T. Boi, crossingswords, .turfy, pudapus, TheStormQueen, eq., jeraldist, Brovya Edinoroga, Eternal221, Magicoal, Ωbscυriα. (mereeq), Nico Elyon, MidnightProphet, AmonNonza, Izak McCourt\\nOriginally posted by tModLoader Redemption:\\nDeveloped By Halm & Tied\",\"stats\":\"578.527 MB | 25 Nov, 2022 @ 10:30pm | 7 Aug @ 1:01am\",\"tags\":\"\"}"
